  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "WINS Replication: Check for bytes existing",
  "description": "WINS Replication has a 32-bit unsigned length for the NetBIOS name,\nwhich can be, in fuzzed data, much larger than the 16-characters\nthat get_netbios_name examines in the TVB. So verify that the\nbytes skipped over actually exist, in particular to avoid problems\nif the length is really large and causes the offset to overflow.\n\n(The infinite loop is avoided in earlier branches because the\ntvb_new_subset_length call will throw an error if the length\nwhen cast to an int is less than -1.)\n\nFix: #21068\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
